          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Combined multiplier}&=1.1\\times1.1\\times1.1\\\\&=1.331\\\\\\text{Overall increase}&=133.1\\%-100\\%\\\\&=33.1\\%\\end{align*}$$",
